      "hizbQuarter": 97,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1652,
      "text": "This is how We established Joseph in the land[22] so that he may settle wherever he wished. We extend Our mercy to whom We will, and We do not let the reward of those who do good to go to waste.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 242,
      "ruku": 199,
      "hizbQuarter": 97,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1653,
      "text": "But the reward of the Hereafter is better for those who believe and fear Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
